  <Translations>
    <Translation Language="en-US">Your previous purchase didn't get confirmed. Finish it, or choose other tickets: that one will be voided with no charge.</Translation>
    <Translation Language="es-CO">Tu compra anterior no alcanzó a confirmarse. Termínala, o elige otras entradas: esa quedará anulada sin cobro.</Translation>
